<title>AUSTRALIA: Packer to end Sydney casino deal-report.</title>
<headline>Packer to end Sydney casino deal-report.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Billionaire businessman Kerry Packer is preparing to withdraw his company's offer to buy control of Sydney Harbour Casino Holdings Ltd to concentrate on a bid for newspaper publisher John Fairfax Holdings Ltd, the Australian newspaper said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Packer's media company Publishing and Broadcasting Ltd said in January it planned to buy 10 percent of Sydney Harbour Casino from Showboat Inc for A$101.75 million and pay A$240 million for management control of the casino.</p>
<p>The deal still has to be approved by the Casino Control Authority in the state of New South Wales.</p>
</text>
